<title>USA: Horace Mann Educators Corp Q1 oper net up.</title>
<headline>Horace Mann Educators Corp Q1 oper net up.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD, Ill. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.80		    $0.68</p>
<p> Oper net		  18,800		   16,100</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 oper earnings exclude realized investment gains of $0.02/shr in 1997 and $0.06/shr in 1996, losses of $0.04/shr in 1996 and debt retirement costs of $0.04/shr in 1996, after tax. Total insurance premiums written and contract deposits were $179.9 million in Q197 vs. $164 million in Q196.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
